// SaysList :
"P1228893165" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>It's a great shame to have lost those relays, but at this point it was the only way.  And in just a moment I should be able to see if...<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>Yes! I've got it. With this data, I think I have a way to prevent the Shivans from awakening further.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>Still, I am suspicious of the timing of this breakin. Someone may have wanted to prevent my research from coming to fruition...<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>Watch out, {HeroName}.  It looks like the leader of their group is looking to escape!  Track down and apprehend that goon, so that I can question him later!"
// SaysList :
"P1044951812" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>It's no use, {HeroName}.  I'm monitoring his heart palpatations; it would appear that he's lying through his teeth.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>However, he was telling the truth about breaking and entering.  Ultimately, I don't think he knows anything.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>I've tapped into the teleporter system and will be sending him straight to the local police station.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>In the meantime, I'm going to start working on a plan to prevent the Shivans from awakening further. Thank you for your help, {HeroName}.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>Oh... and you may want to inform Twinshot that her security detail wasn't as tight as she thought it to be."

