// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3216024997" "Proton just sent me word about how you were there just in time to help him.  I'm going to need to find out how those Skulls knew when exactly to break into the place.  I'm pretty sure that won't happen again, but it's best if I made absolutely certain we don't ever have a repeat of today."
// RandomFameString :
