"P1249915956" "Dillo and Grym still need a hand.  You should be able to find Dillo in King's Row."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1760641997" "Dillo advised that you might want to apprehend some of the Skulls in case they still have some equipment from base on them.  Afterwards, you should stop by the University."

