// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2940141944" "You've arrived at the University.  Now would be a good time to learn about inventions if you haven't already done so.  Afterwards, go speak with Grym in Skyway City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1374915622" "Talk to Grym"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P205080728" "Grym should be nosing around the University.  Get it?  'Nosing'?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3332586983" "You've spoken with Grym and have learned that the Clockworks may still have some of Proton's equipment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1930174680" "Destroy Clockwork on the rooftops of Steel Canyon"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1940725812" "Doing away with the clockwork automatons should prevent the Clockwork King from making himself more of a menace than he already is. Not to mention, you might find some of our stuff in the process, you know?"
// VillainDescription :
"P2524987474" "Defeat {Remain} Clockwork"
// VillainSingularDescription :
"P3637813628" "One last Clockwork remains"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3484966427" "You managed to do away with enough clockwork that if any of them had any of your remaining equipment, they don't any longer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2500615447" "Hey, you're back.  Looks like all of our searches turned up nothing.  Proton has a back-up plan, though... well, like the guy always does.  If we can't find the guy or gal who came back in time to screw around with the Shivan attack, then we're just gonna have to change it back.  Right?"
// RandomFameString :
"P873942212" "Look, it's {HeroName}.  Sure is nice knowing there are less thugs and wonky robots on the streets!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Flambeaux 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3362909411" "Hey, {HeroName}! Thanks for dealing with those Clockwork. I had it covered, but I figured you'd want to feel like you're helping."
// Answer Text :
"P1872640438" "Thanks for thinking about me, Flambeaux."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1460746664" "You're welcome, sweetie.<br><br>So, Proton's stuff should be in here somewhere. All we need to do is find the crate that's labelled 'Table Sizing Feelers' - sounds kinky, eh? - and then we get out of here!  Simple as that, eh?"
// Answer Text :
"P1011625434" "Well, it sounds simple..."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2342199542" "My family doesn't call me simple for nothing!   Don't worry, this will be totally easy.  What could possibly go wrong?"
// Answer Text :
"P1410053197" "That's what I'm afraid of."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1348442963" "So, we may have a problem. Proton needs some of the devices that were stolen from him, and it seems the Clockwork King might be the one who still has them.  You're going to need to break into one of his warehouses and steal everything back.<br><br>You'll be walking straight into enemy territory, so I decided to assign you a partner. Unfortunately, I can't seem to get ahold of Grym, and Dillo is helping Proton with his work, so..."
// AcceptString :
"P3471057598" "Oh. Fantastic."
// SendOffString :
"P2717104777" "C'mon, don't be like that, kiddo. Flambeaux is a hothead, sure, and she might be a little spacey at times, but she's got power enough to spare. Keep her on the right track and I'm sure she'll be able to help out if things get rough.<br><br>I've asked her to wait for you outside the warehouse, but knowing her... well, let's just say the quicker you get there, the better."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2592231030" "Recover Proton's Equipment"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2702463501" "Predictably, Flambeaux started without you. You'd better find her before she gets in over her head."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P746819442" "<color deepskyblue>One Man's Treasure</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3826416063" "This looks like the place.  Now you just need to find Flambeaux."

