// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SaysList :
"P1989170310" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Okay, I'm getting feed now, {HeroName}.  I'm down here in the lab below recording everything.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>The first test will be you encountering a group of holograms that'll look like a group of mooks that you'll find working for The Family.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>These guys are throwbacks to back when Paragon City was run by gangsters.  Unfortunately, you'll find they just don't want to let go of the past, you know?<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>They'll be waiting for you in the display room up the stairs."
// SaysList :
"P1989683674" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Good work, {HeroName}.  I was able to get all that.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>You know, Manticore's got some nice hardware lining his place.  Must be nice to have a supergroup base all to your own.  Most times, bases like these are shared. <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>I tell you what... if all of us break up, I'm joining a supergroup that's loaded with teleporters and all that kinda jazz.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Wow... total tangent there.  Okay, next up will be some Trolls.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>These guys are strung out on Superadyne, making them all look like television bodybuilders or something.  If you don't know what that stuff is, then all the better for ya."
// SaysList :
"P3370208576" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Okay, we're done with the upper floor.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Head downstairs and find the Observation terminal in the Council Chamber.  It'll be right in front of you when you get to the lower level.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Go ahead and flip it on so I can keep gathering your combat data.  And while you're there, count your lucky stars that you're one of the few that are allowed to actually see that place.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Not just anyone gets to hang out in the chamber where the Freedom Phalanx holds their meetings.  Or plays pen and paper roleplaying games, or whatever they do down there."
// SaysList :
"P975243595" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Pretty snazzy in that council room, eh?<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>The last group I worked for had a really nice lounge.  I guess when you have your own base, you can pick whatever you want to fill up the place.  Must be nice. <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Okay, I'm going to need you to head towards the lab now.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Along the way I'm going to hit you with some Vahzilok meatpuppets.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Their leader, Dr. Vahzilok makes Dr. Frankenstein look like a pediatrician.  Hop to it, {HeroName}."
// SaysList :
"P35552514" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Alright, good so far. Next I'm going to have you tackle some Outcasts.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>They may look like regular street thugs, but watch yourself. These punks have elemental powers that will knock you on your feet if you're not careful.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>It's a shame these guys chose to mess with Paragon instead of trying to help. Some of the Outcasts have some Hero potential, but they'd need to pull a full 180 first, you know?"
// SaysList :
"P2894299814" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>We're just about done.  Up next are some guys from The Council.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Get this... these guys are, like, holdouts from WWII. Some of the super soldiers back then infiltrated Paragon, and they've been causing trouble ever since.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>They've also made some bad deals with some bad aliens, so watch out."
// SaysList :
"P2478939018" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Okay, here's the last one then we can go home.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.4 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>You get to fight some of your old Clockwork buddies again.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Hmmm... you know what?  I'm cancelling this one, since you've already fought them enough.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Gimme a sec as I close down this prog -- WHAT THE ---"

