// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3927334388" "You finished all of your combat tests for Proton and should have enough data to help him out.  It's a good thing Manticore and Positron's simulators didn't all go haywire the way the last one did!  You could've gotten hurt!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P315666282" "Well, I've given Proton all of the data and he looked relieved.  He says he's calculating success probabilities and all that.  I asked him what would happen if we just ran in there shouting our names.  We'll just say he looked horrified.<br><br>Now all we need to do is wait until we get the go from the ole' egghead.  And then we bring the fight to the Shivans, not the other way around!"
// RandomFameString :
"P623521377" "Will you look at that? {HeroName} looks winded, kinda the way you look after a good workout!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - TwinshotOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3122258950" "Hey, kiddo.  You ready to tangle with the big A?<br><br>What am I saying, this is {HeroName} I'm talking about. Of course you're ready."
// Answer Text :
"P246234120" "What in the heck is going on, Twinshot?"
// Page ConvoNode1 Text :
"P2104127204" "Arachnos swooped in on the place with a full invasion force the moment we got here.  There's a call out for other heroes, but by the time anyone else gets here it'll be too late to destroy these meteors."
// Answer Text :
"P3963332066" "So that means...?"
// Page SecondFloor Text :
"P1886678961" "That means we need to get these stabilizers in place and we need to do it yesterday.  We're scattered all over the place so that Proton can get his stabilizers in place, but it's looking like there are too many of these Arachnos to do it solo.  I've got a plan, though."
// Answer Text :
"P1480566491" "What's the plan?"
// Page ThirdFloor Text :
"P1270904880" "I'm going go hit the end of the street and place the stabilizer.  I've got special forces training that'll let me get through these mobs undetected.  You go find the others and gather them all together into one taskforce so we can get the rest of the stabilizers in place.  Proton said that once placed, these babies will do their stuff and the timestream will be corrected.<br><br>I have no idea how, but I'm not the brainiac here."
// Answer Text :
"P948990890" "If we're going to do this, we need to do this now."
// Page LockDown Text :
"P2585564681" "Roger that, good buddy.  Now go help the others!  There's a meteor just up ahead, so you should find one of them there!  Catch you on the flipside!"
// Answer Text :
"P1672028801" "I've got this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ManticoreOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1745938396" "Keep your voice down and listen very closely."
// Answer Text :
"P3548349023" "Okay."
// Page ConvoNode1 Text :
"P468183779" "I've been keeping an eye on you, squirt.  And because of that, you're in the clear.  That's why I'm about to entrust in you something very important.  I need you to track down who brought those Praetorian machines here, completely undetected until the last moment."
// Answer Text :
"P3664869672" "Wait, those robots were from Praetoria?"
// Page SecondFloor Text :
"P835998429" "I could have swore the first thing I said was for you to listen.  Let's try this again.  You're going to be my eyes and ears, reporting back to me anything you find about this attack.<br><br>These weren't my guys in costumes.  These were the real thing, and let me tell you... I don't like their kind in my city.  This is where you come in."
// Answer Text :
"P1500499101" "But how on Earth am ---"
// Page ThirdFloor Text :
"P2730933055" "You're the one who's going to find out because you're trusted.  Not just by me, but by a number of other people.  The same ones who were responsible for those Clockwork appearing in the middle of Paragon City.<br><br>You see, we were able to trace back the origin of the 'beacon' that they used to get in.  It seems they were called here.  Invited to come take these meteors for whatever purposes they planned.  In other words, someone called them and told them everything.<br><br>And those calls came from inside your new base."
// Answer Text :
"P2735106661" "Our base?  But that would mean ---"
// Page LockDown Text :
"P4219724374" "Exactly.<br><br>One of you is a traitor."
// Answer Text :
"P3514462294" "..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4233002415" "Okay, this it!  We're going to get these Field Stabilizers in place and destroy those Shivan meteors once and for all.  Even though Galaxy City is being rebuilt, there's still a small section where the meteors were too volatile to transport.  And that's where we're gonna hit them where it hurts.  I don't know the details, but whatever it is, it'll be big enough to send shockwaves back to where ever it is that these Shivans are from.<br><br>The whole team is on their way over there right now.  You ready to do this?"
// AcceptString :
"P1004432928" "You can count on me!"
// SendOffString :
"P3667570998" "Manticore has the place cordoned off so we shouldn't be bothered by any street gangs who get too curious for their own good.  The plan is for us to set down these devices as close to the meteors as possible, and let them do their magic.  Actually, do their opposite-of-magic, to be more precise.  I'm not expecting this to be a walk in the park, but after watching you fight?  I'm pretty sure we can handle whatever pops up.<br><br>I'll meet you there, kiddo!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1465448893" "Destroy the Meteors!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1331579721" "What's up, kiddo!  We're waiting for you over in Galaxy City!  Get a move on, will ya!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2974779128" "<color deepskyblue>Uninvited Guests</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2953010068" "This place is swimming in Arachnos agents. Quickly, find out what's going on from Twinshot!"

