// Objective - ManticoreUnleashed 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1916354886" "Manticore has been behind this the whole time!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2600904208" "You've succeeded in your mission, but Manticore's information has left you stunned."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P416240043" "So, um... I guess you caught a good chunk of my conversation with Eddie. Awkward.<br><br>I knew him way back when, kiddo. He and I went separate ways a long time ago... it was a bit of a shock to see him again, you know? I can tell you, Galaxy was the last place I expected <i>him</i> to show up.<br><br>Anyway, that's a part of my past that's well behind me now. I don't...<br><br><color orange>For the first time since you've known her, Twinshot's trademark grin falters.</color><br><br>I don't really want to talk about it anymore."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
